Heimdall License
================

Heimdall is a derivative work in the Bjorn lineage:

    Bjorn     (c) 2024     infinition          https://github.com/infinition/Bjorn
    Ragnar    (c) 2024-26  Pierre Gode         https://github.com/PierreGode/Ragnar
    Heimdall  (c) 2026     SneezeGUI

Ragnar is itself a derivative work of Bjorn. Heimdall therefore carries three
sets of terms. Each governs its own portions; none of them relicense the
portions belonging to the others.

  * Part A — MIT License, governing the original Bjorn-derived portions.
  * Part B — Supplemental Terms (Ragnar Contributions), retained verbatim from
    the Ragnar project and still governing Ragnar's own code, assets, branding,
    and documentation as they appear in this repository.
  * Part C — Heimdall Contributions, covering SneezeGUI's original additions.

Where these parts conflict for a given portion, the part that governs that
portion controls. In particular, Part A governs Bjorn-derived code; Part B
governs Ragnar-derived code; Part C governs only Heimdall-original code.


