Lineage summary
---------------

Bjorn (infinition) is the origin. Ragnar (Pierre Gode) is Bjorn's successor
and remains independently maintained at its canonical source. Heimdall
(SneezeGUI) continues from Ragnar, keeps both upstreams' terms intact, and
shares bugfixes upstream where appropriate.
